window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a464-836a048bb188e808.json"]={sha256:"836a048bb188e808423f8cb0deb2e5a33b1fb090342f8c4349e5c6a4619a2e5a",value:{"id":"a464","title":"閃爍體粒子偵測器","titleEn":"Scintillation particle detectors","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 NaI(Tl)、LYSO 晶體與 EJ-200 塑膠閃爍體為例，追蹤一個 662 keV 伽瑪光子如何變成數萬個閃爍光子、數千個光電子與一個可校正的脈衝，並把 Birks 淬滅、光學耦合與反射層、PMT 與 SiPM、能量解析度分解、溫度增益漂移與符合計時整合成可交接的偵測器工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Using NaI(Tl), LYSO crystals and EJ-200 plastic, the course follows a 662 keV gamma ray as it becomes tens of thousands of scintillation photons, thousands of photoelectrons and one calibratable pulse, then integrates Birks quenching, optical coupling and reflectors, PMTs and SiPMs, energy-resolution decomposition, temperature-driven gain drift and coincidence timing into a transferable detector engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-accelerators-detectors","subcategoryTitle":"加速器、光束線與粒子偵測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Accelerators, beamlines and particle detectors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-accelerators-detectors","learningTags":["optics","optics-accelerators-detectors","detector"],"architectureFamily":"detector","architectureNodes":[["閃爍晶體或塑膠","Scintillator crystal or plastic"],["反射層與光學耦合","Reflector and optical coupling"],["PMT 或 SiPM 光偵測器","PMT or SiPM photodetector"],["前端放大與數位化","Front-end amplification and digitisation"],["偏壓與溫度補償","Bias and temperature compensation"],["能量與時間校正、符合邏輯","Energy and time calibration, coincidence logic"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[4,2],[3,5],[5,4]],"diagram":{"type":"detector","labels":["閃爍晶體或塑膠","反射層與光學耦合","PMT 或 SiPM 光偵測器","前端放大與數位化","偏壓與溫度補償"],"labelsEn":["Scintillator crystal or plastic","Reflector and optical coupling","PMT or SiPM photodetector","Front-end amplification and digitisation","Bias and temperature compensation"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"NaI(Tl) 伽瑪能譜儀練習：76 mm 晶體在 ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 光電峰產生 38×662 ≈ 25 160 個光子。假設光收集 0.65、PMT 量子效率 0.28，N_pe = 25 160×0.65×0.28 ≈ 4580；超額雜訊因子 1.2 時統計項 2.355×√(1.2/4580) ≈ 3.8%。再假設晶體非比例性與不均勻性合計 5.5%，總解析度 √(3.8² + 5.5²) ≈ 6.7% FWHM，即約 44 keV。康普頓邊緣 E_C = E/(1 + m_ec²/2E) = 662/(1 + 511/1324) ≈ 478 keV，背散射峰約 662 − 478 ≈ 184 keV。若把 PMT 換成 PDE 0.40 的 SiPM 陣列且光收集不變，N_pe ≈ 6540，統計項降到約 3.2%，總解析度只改善到約 6.4%，顯示本質項主導。數值為教學假設，不代表任何產品規格。","textEn":"NaI(Tl) gamma-spectrometer exercise: a 76 mm crystal produces 38×662 ≈ 25 160 photons in the ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV photopeak. Assuming light collection 0.65 and PMT quantum efficiency 0.28, N_pe = 25 160×0.65×0.28 ≈ 4580; with an excess noise factor of 1.2 the statistical term is 2.355×√(1.2/4580) ≈ 3.8%. Assuming crystal non-proportionality and non-uniformity together contribute 5.5%, the total resolution is √(3.8² + 5.5²) ≈ 6.7% FWHM, about 44 keV. The Compton edge is E_C = E/(1 + m_ec²/2E) = 662/(1 + 511/1324) ≈ 478 keV and the backscatter peak lies near 662 − 478 ≈ 184 keV. Replacing the PMT with a SiPM array of PDE 0.40 at unchanged light collection gives N_pe ≈ 6540, lowering the statistical term to about 3.2% but the total only to about 6.4%, showing that the intrinsic term dominates. Values are teaching assumptions, not any product's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a464-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間」與「Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time\" and \"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a464-v12-01","title":"閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「活化劑發光中心與衰減時間」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Activator luminescence centre and decay time” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"無機晶體中，游離粒子產生的電子電洞對在晶格中遷移，被 Tl⁺ 或 Ce³⁺ 等活化劑捕獲後以可見光釋放能量，光產額高但衰減時間從數十到數百奈秒；有機與塑膠閃爍體則由苯環 π 電子的螢光發光，光產額較低但衰減只有數奈秒。發光波長必須落在晶體本身透明且光偵測器敏感的範圍內，塑膠閃爍體因此加入波長轉換劑。選材時光產額決定能量解析度，衰減時間決定計數率與計時能力，密度與原子序決定攔截效率，三者必須同時權衡。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「活化劑發光中心與衰減時間」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In inorganic crystals the electron–hole pairs created by an ionising particle migrate through the lattice until activators such as Tl⁺ or Ce³⁺ capture them and release the energy as visible light, giving high yield with decay times from tens to hundreds of nanoseconds; organic and plastic scintillators emit by fluorescence of π electrons in aromatic rings, with lower yield but decay of only a few nanoseconds. Emission must fall where the material is transparent and the photodetector is sensitive, which is why plastics include wavelength shifters. Light yield sets energy resolution, decay time sets count rate and timing, and density and atomic number set stopping efficiency, so material choice balances all three. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Activator luminescence centre and decay time”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：NaI(Tl) 光產額約 38 光子/keV，662 keV 沉積產生 38×662 ≈ 25 200 個光子；以 410 nm（3.02 eV）計，約 11.5% 的沉積能量變成光。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: NaI(Tl) yields about 38 photons/keV, so a 662 keV deposit produces 38×662 ≈ 25 200 photons; at 410 nm (3.02 eV) about 11.5% of the deposited energy becomes light.","failure":"常見誤解：「光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「活化劑發光中心與衰減時間」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Activator luminescence centre and decay time”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-01-k1","title":"閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間","titleEn":"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time","text":"無機晶體中，游離粒子產生的電子電洞對在晶格中遷移，被 Tl⁺ 或 Ce³⁺ 等活化劑捕獲後以可見光釋放能量，光產額高但衰減時間從數十到數百奈秒；有機與塑膠閃爍體則由苯環 π 電子的螢光發光，光產額較低但衰減只有數奈秒。發光波長必須落在晶體本身透明且光偵測器敏感的範圍內，塑膠閃爍體因此加入波長轉換劑。","textEn":"In inorganic crystals the electron–hole pairs created by an ionising particle migrate through the lattice until activators such as Tl⁺ or Ce³⁺ capture them and release the energy as visible light, giving high yield with decay times from tens to hundreds of nanoseconds; organic and plastic scintillators emit by fluorescence of π electrons in aromatic rings, with lower yield but decay of only a few nanoseconds. Emission must fall where the material is transparent and the photodetector is sensitive, which is why plastics include wavelength shifters.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time\" is correct?","options":["光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。","無機晶體中，游離粒子產生的電子電洞對在晶格中遷移，被 Tl⁺ 或 Ce³⁺ 等活化劑捕獲後以可見光釋放能量，光產額高但衰減時間從數十到數百奈秒。","同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。"],"optionsEn":["The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.","In inorganic crystals the electron–hole pairs created by an ionising particle migrate through the lattice until activators such as Tl⁺ or Ce³⁺ capture them and release the energy as visible light, giving high yield with decay times from tens to hundreds of nanoseconds.","Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator."],"answer":1,"explanation":"無機晶體中，游離粒子產生的電子電洞對在晶格中遷移，被 Tl⁺ 或 Ce³⁺ 等活化劑捕獲後以可見光釋放能量，光產額高但衰減時間從數十到數百奈秒；有機與塑膠閃爍體則由苯環 π 電子的螢光發光，光產額較低但衰減只有數奈秒。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In inorganic crystals the electron–hole pairs created by an ionising particle migrate through the lattice until activators such as Tl⁺ or Ce³⁺ capture them and release the energy as visible light, giving high yield with decay times from tens to hundreds of nanoseconds; organic and plastic scintillators emit by fluorescence of π electrons in aromatic rings, with lower yield but decay of only a few nanoseconds. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a464-v12-02","title":"閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「活化劑發光中心與衰減時間」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Activator luminescence centre and decay time” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：NaI(Tl) 光產額約 38 光子/keV，662 keV 沉積產生 38×662 ≈ 25 200 個光子；以 410 nm（3.02 eV）計，約 11.5% 的沉積能量變成光。相對 NaI(Tl)，LSO/LYSO 約 85%、衰減約 40 ns，BGO 約 21%、衰減約 300 ns；EJ-200 約 10 000 光子/MeV、衰減 2.1 ns。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: NaI(Tl) yields about 38 photons/keV, so a 662 keV deposit produces 38×662 ≈ 25 200 photons; at 410 nm (3.02 eV) about 11.5% of the deposited energy becomes light. Relative to NaI(Tl), LSO/LYSO gives about 85% with about 40 ns decay and BGO about 21% with about 300 ns; EJ-200 gives about 10 000 photons/MeV with 2.1 ns decay. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以同一支已校正的 PMT 與相同耦合條件，依序量測待測晶體與參考 NaI(Tl) 晶體在 ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 的光電峰位置，比值即為相對光產額；以快速示波器或時間相關單光子計數量測脈衝波形並擬合衰減常數，與規格書比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: With the same calibrated PMT and identical coupling, measure the 662 keV ¹³⁷Cs photopeak position of the crystal under test and of a reference NaI(Tl) crystal in turn, taking the ratio as relative light yield; record pulse shapes with a fast oscilloscope or time-correlated single-photon counting and fit decay constants for comparison with the datasheet.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"NaI(Tl) 光產額約 38 光子/keV，662 keV 沉積產生 38×662 ≈ 25 200 個光子；以 410 nm（3.02 eV）計，約 11.5% 的沉積能量變成光。相對 NaI(Tl)，LSO/LYSO 約 85%、衰減約 40 ns，BGO 約 21%、衰減約 300 ns；EJ-200 約 10 000 光子/MeV、衰減 2.1 ns。","textEn":"NaI(Tl) yields about 38 photons/keV, so a 662 keV deposit produces 38×662 ≈ 25 200 photons; at 410 nm (3.02 eV) about 11.5% of the deposited energy becomes light. Relative to NaI(Tl), LSO/LYSO gives about 85% with about 40 ns decay and BGO about 21% with about 300 ns; EJ-200 gives about 10 000 photons/MeV with 2.1 ns decay.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time\", which statement holds?","options":["SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。","能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。","NaI(Tl) 光產額約 38 光子/keV，662 keV 沉積產生 38×662 ≈ 25 200 個光子。"],"optionsEn":["A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons.","Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.","NaI(Tl) yields about 38 photons/keV, so a 662 keV deposit produces 38×662 ≈ 25 200 photons."],"answer":2,"explanation":"NaI(Tl) 光產額約 38 光子/keV，662 keV 沉積產生 38×662 ≈ 25 200 個光子；以 410 nm（3.02 eV）計，約 11.5% 的沉積能量變成光。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"NaI(Tl) yields about 38 photons/keV, so a 662 keV deposit produces 38×662 ≈ 25 200 photons; at 410 nm (3.02 eV) about 11.5% of the deposited energy becomes light. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a464-v12-03","title":"閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「活化劑發光中心與衰減時間」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Activator luminescence centre and decay time” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以同一支已校正的 PMT 與相同耦合條件，依序量測待測晶體與參考 NaI(Tl) 晶體在 ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 的光電峰位置，比值即為相對光產額；以快速示波器或時間相關單光子計數量測脈衝波形並擬合衰減常數，與規格書比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"With the same calibrated PMT and identical coupling, measure the 662 keV ¹³⁷Cs photopeak position of the crystal under test and of a reference NaI(Tl) crystal in turn, taking the ratio as relative light yield; record pulse shapes with a fast oscilloscope or time-correlated single-photon counting and fit decay constants for comparison with the datasheet. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：NaI(Tl) 會吸濕，封裝漏氣後表面潮解變黃，光產額與均勻性逐漸下降，光電峰向低能漂移並變寬；若只用定期能量刻度修正而不檢查封裝，數月後才會發現解析度已不可接受。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: NaI(Tl) is hygroscopic: once the housing leaks the surface hydrates and yellows, light yield and uniformity fall, and the photopeak drifts down and broadens; correcting only with periodic energy recalibration without inspecting the housing reveals the unacceptable resolution months later.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以同一支已校正的 PMT 與相同耦合條件，依序量測待測晶體與參考 NaI(Tl) 晶體在 ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 的光電峰位置，比值即為相對光產額；以快速示波器或時間相關單光子計數量測脈衝波形並擬合衰減常數，與規格書比較。","textEn":"With the same calibrated PMT and identical coupling, measure the 662 keV ¹³⁷Cs photopeak position of the crystal under test and of a reference NaI(Tl) crystal in turn, taking the ratio as relative light yield; record pulse shapes with a fast oscilloscope or time-correlated single-photon counting and fit decay constants for comparison with the datasheet.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time\"?","options":["以同一支已校正的 PMT 與相同耦合條件，依序量測待測晶體與參考 NaI(Tl) 晶體在 ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 的光電峰位置，比值即為相對光產額。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。"],"optionsEn":["With the same calibrated PMT and identical coupling, measure the 662 keV ¹³⁷Cs photopeak position of the crystal under test and of a reference NaI(Tl) crystal in turn, taking the ratio as relative light yield.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以同一支已校正的 PMT 與相同耦合條件，依序量測待測晶體與參考 NaI(Tl) 晶體在 ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 的光電峰位置，比值即為相對光產額；以快速示波器或時間相關單光子計數量測脈衝波形並擬合衰減常數，與規格書比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"With the same calibrated PMT and identical coupling, measure the 662 keV ¹³⁷Cs photopeak position of the crystal under test and of a reference NaI(Tl) crystal in turn, taking the ratio as relative light yield; record pulse shapes with a fast oscilloscope or time-correlated single-photon counting and fit decay constants for comparison with the datasheet. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a464-v12-04","title":"閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「活化劑發光中心與衰減時間」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Activator luminescence centre and decay time” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"NaI(Tl) 會吸濕，封裝漏氣後表面潮解變黃，光產額與均勻性逐漸下降，光電峰向低能漂移並變寬；若只用定期能量刻度修正而不檢查封裝，數月後才會發現解析度已不可接受。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"NaI(Tl) is hygroscopic: once the housing leaks the surface hydrates and yellows, light yield and uniformity fall, and the photopeak drifts down and broadens; correcting only with periodic energy recalibration without inspecting the housing reveals the unacceptable resolution months later. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：選材時光產額決定能量解析度，衰減時間決定計數率與計時能力，密度與原子序決定攔截效率，三者必須同時權衡。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Light yield sets energy resolution, decay time sets count rate and timing, and density and atomic number set stopping efficiency, so material choice balances all three.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"NaI(Tl) 會吸濕，封裝漏氣後表面潮解變黃，光產額與均勻性逐漸下降，光電峰向低能漂移並變寬；若只用定期能量刻度修正而不檢查封裝，數月後才會發現解析度已不可接受。","textEn":"NaI(Tl) is hygroscopic: once the housing leaks the surface hydrates and yellows, light yield and uniformity fall, and the photopeak drifts down and broadens; correcting only with periodic energy recalibration without inspecting the housing reveals the unacceptable resolution months later.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「閃爍機制、光產額與衰減時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scintillation mechanism, light yield and decay time\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","NaI(Tl) 會吸濕，封裝漏氣後表面潮解變黃，光產額與均勻性逐漸下降，光電峰向低能漂移並變寬。","同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","NaI(Tl) is hygroscopic: once the housing leaks the surface hydrates and yellows, light yield and uniformity fall, and the photopeak drifts down and broadens.","Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator."],"answer":1,"explanation":"NaI(Tl) 會吸濕，封裝漏氣後表面潮解變黃，光產額與均勻性逐漸下降，光電峰向低能漂移並變寬；若只用定期能量刻度修正而不檢查封裝，數月後才會發現解析度已不可接受。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"NaI(Tl) is hygroscopic: once the housing leaks the surface hydrates and yellows, light yield and uniformity fall, and the photopeak drifts down and broadens; correcting only with periodic energy recalibration without inspecting the housing reveals the unacceptable resolution months later. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a464-v12-05","title":"Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「高 dE/dx 徑跡與電子等效能量」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “High-dE/dx track and electron-equivalent energy” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"閃爍光輸出並不嚴格正比於沉積能量：沿徑跡的游離密度越高，激發分子彼此淬滅與復合的機率越大，單位能量產生的光越少，這就是 Birks 淬滅。電子與最小游離粒子幾乎不受影響，但質子、α 粒子與重離子的光輸出被大幅壓低，所以能量刻度必須以電子等效能量 keVee 表示，並針對每種粒子另做換算。有機閃爍體中不同粒子的慢成分比例也不同，這正是脈衝形狀鑑別分辨中子與伽瑪的物理基礎。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「高 dE/dx 徑跡與電子等效能量」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Scintillation output is not strictly proportional to deposited energy: the higher the ionisation density along the track, the more excited molecules quench and recombine with one another and the less light each unit of energy produces, which is Birks quenching. Electrons and minimum-ionising particles are barely affected, but light from protons, alphas and heavy ions is strongly suppressed, so the energy scale is quoted in electron-equivalent keVee and converted separately for each particle type. In organic scintillators the slow-component fraction also differs between particles, which is the physical basis of pulse-shape discrimination between neutrons and gammas. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “High-dE/dx track and electron-equivalent energy”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Birks 公式 dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx)，聚苯乙烯 kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Birks' formula is dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx), with kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV for polystyrene.","failure":"常見誤解：「同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「高 dE/dx 徑跡與電子等效能量」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “High-dE/dx track and electron-equivalent energy”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-05-k1","title":"Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出","titleEn":"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output","text":"閃爍光輸出並不嚴格正比於沉積能量：沿徑跡的游離密度越高，激發分子彼此淬滅與復合的機率越大，單位能量產生的光越少，這就是 Birks 淬滅。電子與最小游離粒子幾乎不受影響，但質子、α 粒子與重離子的光輸出被大幅壓低，所以能量刻度必須以電子等效能量 keVee 表示，並針對每種粒子另做換算。","textEn":"Scintillation output is not strictly proportional to deposited energy: the higher the ionisation density along the track, the more excited molecules quench and recombine with one another and the less light each unit of energy produces, which is Birks quenching. Electrons and minimum-ionising particles are barely affected, but light from protons, alphas and heavy ions is strongly suppressed, so the energy scale is quoted in electron-equivalent keVee and converted separately for each particle type.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output\" is correct?","options":["同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。","晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。","閃爍光輸出並不嚴格正比於沉積能量：沿徑跡的游離密度越高，激發分子彼此淬滅與復合的機率越大，單位能量產生的光越少，這就是 Birks 淬滅。"],"optionsEn":["Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator.","The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light.","Scintillation output is not strictly proportional to deposited energy: the higher the ionisation density along the track, the more excited molecules quench and recombine with one another and the less light each unit of energy produces, which is Birks quenching."],"answer":2,"explanation":"閃爍光輸出並不嚴格正比於沉積能量：沿徑跡的游離密度越高，激發分子彼此淬滅與復合的機率越大，單位能量產生的光越少，這就是 Birks 淬滅。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Scintillation output is not strictly proportional to deposited energy: the higher the ionisation density along the track, the more excited molecules quench and recombine with one another and the less light each unit of energy produces, which is Birks quenching. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a464-v12-06","title":"Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出：定量估算","titleEn":"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「高 dE/dx 徑跡與電子等效能量」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “High-dE/dx track and electron-equivalent energy” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Birks 公式 dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx)，聚苯乙烯 kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV。最小游離電子 dE/dx ≈ 0.2 MeV/mm 時淬滅因子 1/(1 + 0.126×0.2) ≈ 0.975；約 1 MeV 反衝質子 dE/dx ≈ 26 MeV/mm 時因子 ≈ 1/(1 + 3.28) ≈ 0.23，同能量質子只產生電子約四分之一的光。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Birks' formula is dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx), with kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV for polystyrene. A minimum-ionising electron at dE/dx ≈ 0.2 MeV/mm has a quenching factor 1/(1 + 0.126×0.2) ≈ 0.975, while a recoil proton near 1 MeV at dE/dx ≈ 26 MeV/mm has ≈ 1/(1 + 3.28) ≈ 0.23, so a proton gives only about a quarter of the light of an electron of the same energy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以多個伽瑪源的康普頓邊緣建立電子等效刻度，再以單能中子束或飛行時間標定的中子量測反衝質子邊緣，擬合 kB；對脈衝形狀鑑別，以長短積分窗的比值畫出二維散布圖，計算中子與伽瑪兩群的品質因子並確認在目標門檻能量以上可分離。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build the electron-equivalent scale from Compton edges of several gamma sources, then measure recoil-proton edges with a monoenergetic or time-of-flight-tagged neutron beam and fit kB; for pulse-shape discrimination plot the ratio of long and short integration windows as a two-dimensional scatter, compute the figure of merit between neutron and gamma bands and confirm separation above the target threshold.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Birks 公式 dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx)，聚苯乙烯 kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV。最小游離電子 dE/dx ≈ 0.2 MeV/mm 時淬滅因子 1/(1 + 0.126×0.2) ≈ 0.975；約 1 MeV 反衝質子 dE/dx ≈ 26 MeV/mm 時因子 ≈ 1/(1 + 3.28) ≈ 0.23，同能量質子只產生電子約四分之一的光。","textEn":"Birks' formula is dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx), with kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV for polystyrene. A minimum-ionising electron at dE/dx ≈ 0.2 MeV/mm has a quenching factor 1/(1 + 0.126×0.2) ≈ 0.975, while a recoil proton near 1 MeV at dE/dx ≈ 26 MeV/mm has ≈ 1/(1 + 3.28) ≈ 0.23, so a proton gives only about a quarter of the light of an electron of the same energy.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output\", which statement holds?","options":["Birks 公式 dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx)，聚苯乙烯 kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV。","只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。","衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。"],"optionsEn":["Birks' formula is dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx), with kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV for polystyrene.","A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit.","A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Birks 公式 dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx)，聚苯乙烯 kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Birks' formula is dL/dx = S·(dE/dx)/(1 + kB·dE/dx), with kB ≈ 0.126 mm/MeV for polystyrene. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a464-v12-07","title":"Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「高 dE/dx 徑跡與電子等效能量」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “High-dE/dx track and electron-equivalent energy” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以多個伽瑪源的康普頓邊緣建立電子等效刻度，再以單能中子束或飛行時間標定的中子量測反衝質子邊緣，擬合 kB；對脈衝形狀鑑別，以長短積分窗的比值畫出二維散布圖，計算中子與伽瑪兩群的品質因子並確認在目標門檻能量以上可分離。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build the electron-equivalent scale from Compton edges of several gamma sources, then measure recoil-proton edges with a monoenergetic or time-of-flight-tagged neutron beam and fit kB; for pulse-shape discrimination plot the ratio of long and short integration windows as a two-dimensional scatter, compute the figure of merit between neutron and gamma bands and confirm separation above the target threshold. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把電子刻度直接套用在質子或 α 粒子上，會把沉積能量低估三到五倍，造成中子能譜或粒子鑑別的系統誤差；門檻若設在 keVee 而設計文件寫成質子能量，偵測效率會與預期大不相同。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Applying the electron calibration directly to protons or alphas underestimates deposited energy by three to five times, biasing neutron spectra or particle identification; a threshold set in keVee while the design document assumes proton energy leaves the detection efficiency far from expectation.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以多個伽瑪源的康普頓邊緣建立電子等效刻度，再以單能中子束或飛行時間標定的中子量測反衝質子邊緣，擬合 kB；對脈衝形狀鑑別，以長短積分窗的比值畫出二維散布圖，計算中子與伽瑪兩群的品質因子並確認在目標門檻能量以上可分離。","textEn":"Build the electron-equivalent scale from Compton edges of several gamma sources, then measure recoil-proton edges with a monoenergetic or time-of-flight-tagged neutron beam and fit kB; for pulse-shape discrimination plot the ratio of long and short integration windows as a two-dimensional scatter, compute the figure of merit between neutron and gamma bands and confirm separation above the target threshold.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以多個伽瑪源的康普頓邊緣建立電子等效刻度，再以單能中子束或飛行時間標定的中子量測反衝質子邊緣，擬合 kB。","符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Build the electron-equivalent scale from Compton edges of several gamma sources, then measure recoil-proton edges with a monoenergetic or time-of-flight-tagged neutron beam and fit kB.","Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以多個伽瑪源的康普頓邊緣建立電子等效刻度，再以單能中子束或飛行時間標定的中子量測反衝質子邊緣，擬合 kB；對脈衝形狀鑑別，以長短積分窗的比值畫出二維散布圖，計算中子與伽瑪兩群的品質因子並確認在目標門檻能量以上可分離。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build the electron-equivalent scale from Compton edges of several gamma sources, then measure recoil-proton edges with a monoenergetic or time-of-flight-tagged neutron beam and fit kB; for pulse-shape discrimination plot the ratio of long and short integration windows as a two-dimensional scatter, compute the figure of merit between neutron and gamma bands and confirm separation above the target threshold. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a464-v12-08","title":"Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出：失效診斷","titleEn":"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「高 dE/dx 徑跡與電子等效能量」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “High-dE/dx track and electron-equivalent energy” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把電子刻度直接套用在質子或 α 粒子上，會把沉積能量低估三到五倍，造成中子能譜或粒子鑑別的系統誤差；門檻若設在 keVee 而設計文件寫成質子能量，偵測效率會與預期大不相同。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Applying the electron calibration directly to protons or alphas underestimates deposited energy by three to five times, biasing neutron spectra or particle identification; a threshold set in keVee while the design document assumes proton energy leaves the detection efficiency far from expectation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：有機閃爍體中不同粒子的慢成分比例也不同，這正是脈衝形狀鑑別分辨中子與伽瑪的物理基礎。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In organic scintillators the slow-component fraction also differs between particles, which is the physical basis of pulse-shape discrimination between neutrons and gammas.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把電子刻度直接套用在質子或 α 粒子上，會把沉積能量低估三到五倍，造成中子能譜或粒子鑑別的系統誤差；門檻若設在 keVee 而設計文件寫成質子能量，偵測效率會與預期大不相同。","textEn":"Applying the electron calibration directly to protons or alphas underestimates deposited energy by three to five times, biasing neutron spectra or particle identification; a threshold set in keVee while the design document assumes proton energy leaves the detection efficiency far from expectation.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Birks 淬滅與粒子相依的光輸出」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Birks quenching and particle-dependent light output\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。","把電子刻度直接套用在質子或 α 粒子上，會把沉積能量低估三到五倍，造成中子能譜或粒子鑑別的系統誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light.","Applying the electron calibration directly to protons or alphas underestimates deposited energy by three to five times, biasing neutron spectra or particle identification."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把電子刻度直接套用在質子或 α 粒子上，會把沉積能量低估三到五倍，造成中子能譜或粒子鑑別的系統誤差；門檻若設在 keVee 而設計文件寫成質子能量，偵測效率會與預期大不相同。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying the electron calibration directly to protons or alphas underestimates deposited energy by three to five times, biasing neutron spectra or particle identification; a threshold set in keVee while the design document assumes proton energy leaves the detection efficiency far from expectation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a464-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層」與「PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors\" and \"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a464-v12-09","title":"光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「反射層、光學膠與出光面」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Reflector, optical grease and exit face” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"閃爍光向各方向發射，晶體折射率高（LYSO 約 1.82、NaI 約 1.85），大部分光在出光面因全內反射被困在晶體內，必須經多次反射才能逃出。出光面以折射率接近的光學膠或矽膠墊耦合到光偵測器，可大幅擴大逃逸錐；其餘五面以 PTFE 擴散反射層或多層膜鏡面反射層包覆，把光送回出光面。表面拋光或粗化、反射層與晶體之間是否留空氣隙，都會改變光收集效率與沿長度方向的均勻性。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「反射層、光學膠與出光面」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Scintillation light is emitted in all directions, and with a high crystal index (about 1.82 for LYSO and 1.85 for NaI) most of it is trapped by total internal reflection at the exit face and must bounce many times before escaping. Coupling the exit face to the photodetector with index-matched optical grease or a silicone pad greatly widens the escape cone, while the other five faces are wrapped in diffuse PTFE or specular multilayer reflectors that return light toward the exit face. Polished versus roughened surfaces and whether an air gap is left between reflector and crystal both change light-collection efficiency and its uniformity along the length. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Reflector, optical grease and exit face”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：單次撞擊出光面的逃逸比例 ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2，θc = arcsin(n2/n1)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The fraction escaping on a single strike of the exit face is ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2 with θc = arcsin(n2/n1).","failure":"常見誤解：「晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「反射層、光學膠與出光面」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Reflector, optical grease and exit face”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-09-k1","title":"光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層","titleEn":"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors","text":"閃爍光向各方向發射，晶體折射率高（LYSO 約 1.82、NaI 約 1.85），大部分光在出光面因全內反射被困在晶體內，必須經多次反射才能逃出。出光面以折射率接近的光學膠或矽膠墊耦合到光偵測器，可大幅擴大逃逸錐；其餘五面以 PTFE 擴散反射層或多層膜鏡面反射層包覆，把光送回出光面。","textEn":"Scintillation light is emitted in all directions, and with a high crystal index (about 1.82 for LYSO and 1.85 for NaI) most of it is trapped by total internal reflection at the exit face and must bounce many times before escaping. Coupling the exit face to the photodetector with index-matched optical grease or a silicone pad greatly widens the escape cone, while the other five faces are wrapped in diffuse PTFE or specular multilayer reflectors that return light toward the exit face.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors\" is correct?","options":["閃爍光向各方向發射，晶體折射率高（LYSO 約 1.82、NaI 約 1.85），大部分光在出光面因全內反射被困在晶體內，必須經多次反射才能逃出。","晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。","SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。"],"optionsEn":["Scintillation light is emitted in all directions, and with a high crystal index (about 1.82 for LYSO and 1.85 for NaI) most of it is trapped by total internal reflection at the exit face and must bounce many times before escaping.","The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light.","A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons."],"answer":0,"explanation":"閃爍光向各方向發射，晶體折射率高（LYSO 約 1.82、NaI 約 1.85），大部分光在出光面因全內反射被困在晶體內，必須經多次反射才能逃出。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Scintillation light is emitted in all directions, and with a high crystal index (about 1.82 for LYSO and 1.85 for NaI) most of it is trapped by total internal reflection at the exit face and must bounce many times before escaping. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a464-v12-10","title":"光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層：定量估算","titleEn":"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「反射層、光學膠與出光面」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Reflector, optical grease and exit face” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：單次撞擊出光面的逃逸比例 ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2，θc = arcsin(n2/n1)。LYSO（n = 1.82）對空氣 θc ≈ 33.3°，逃逸比例約 8.2%；改用 n = 1.465 的光學膠，θc ≈ 53.6°，單次逃逸約 20.3%，提高約 2.5 倍，剩下的光靠反射層多次反彈回收。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The fraction escaping on a single strike of the exit face is ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2 with θc = arcsin(n2/n1). LYSO (n = 1.82) to air gives θc ≈ 33.3° and about 8.2% escape; optical grease with n = 1.465 gives θc ≈ 53.6° and about 20.3%, roughly 2.5 times more, with the remainder recovered by repeated reflector bounces. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以準直的伽瑪源或 β 源沿晶體長度逐點照射，記錄光電峰位置得到光收集均勻性曲線；比較不同反射層與耦合材料下的峰位與解析度，並以光線追跡模擬（含表面粗糙度與反射層模型）重現量測，作為量產包覆規格的依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Irradiate the crystal point by point along its length with a collimated gamma or beta source and record the photopeak position to obtain the light-collection uniformity curve; compare peak position and resolution for different reflectors and coupling materials, and reproduce the measurement with ray-tracing simulation that includes surface roughness and reflector models as the basis for production wrapping specifications.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"單次撞擊出光面的逃逸比例 ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2，θc = arcsin(n2/n1)。LYSO（n = 1.82）對空氣 θc ≈ 33.3°，逃逸比例約 8.2%；改用 n = 1.465 的光學膠，θc ≈ 53.6°，單次逃逸約 20.3%，提高約 2.5 倍，剩下的光靠反射層多次反彈回收。","textEn":"The fraction escaping on a single strike of the exit face is ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2 with θc = arcsin(n2/n1). LYSO (n = 1.82) to air gives θc ≈ 33.3° and about 8.2% escape; optical grease with n = 1.465 gives θc ≈ 53.6° and about 20.3%, roughly 2.5 times more, with the remainder recovered by repeated reflector bounces.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors\", which statement holds?","options":["能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。","單次撞擊出光面的逃逸比例 ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2，θc = arcsin(n2/n1)。","符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。"],"optionsEn":["Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.","The fraction escaping on a single strike of the exit face is ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2 with θc = arcsin(n2/n1).","Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"單次撞擊出光面的逃逸比例 ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2，θc = arcsin(n2/n1)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The fraction escaping on a single strike of the exit face is ≈ (1 − cosθc)/2 with θc = arcsin(n2/n1). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a464-v12-11","title":"光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「反射層、光學膠與出光面」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Reflector, optical grease and exit face” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以準直的伽瑪源或 β 源沿晶體長度逐點照射，記錄光電峰位置得到光收集均勻性曲線；比較不同反射層與耦合材料下的峰位與解析度，並以光線追跡模擬（含表面粗糙度與反射層模型）重現量測，作為量產包覆規格的依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Irradiate the crystal point by point along its length with a collimated gamma or beta source and record the photopeak position to obtain the light-collection uniformity curve; compare peak position and resolution for different reflectors and coupling materials, and reproduce the measurement with ray-tracing simulation that includes surface roughness and reflector models as the basis for production wrapping specifications. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：光學膠在熱循環後收縮產生氣泡或脫層，出光面形成局部空氣隙，光收集下降且依位置不同，光電峰出現低能肩部；反射層包覆鬆緊不一時，同批模組的增益差異可達 10% 以上。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Optical grease that shrinks after thermal cycling forms bubbles or delaminates, leaving local air gaps at the exit face that lower light collection position-dependently and add a low-energy shoulder to the photopeak; uneven reflector wrapping can spread gains across a batch of modules by more than 10%.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以準直的伽瑪源或 β 源沿晶體長度逐點照射，記錄光電峰位置得到光收集均勻性曲線；比較不同反射層與耦合材料下的峰位與解析度，並以光線追跡模擬（含表面粗糙度與反射層模型）重現量測，作為量產包覆規格的依據。","textEn":"Irradiate the crystal point by point along its length with a collimated gamma or beta source and record the photopeak position to obtain the light-collection uniformity curve; compare peak position and resolution for different reflectors and coupling materials, and reproduce the measurement with ray-tracing simulation that includes surface roughness and reflector models as the basis for production wrapping specifications.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。","以準直的伽瑪源或 β 源沿晶體長度逐點照射，記錄光電峰位置得到光收集均勻性曲線。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.","Irradiate the crystal point by point along its length with a collimated gamma or beta source and record the photopeak position to obtain the light-collection uniformity curve."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以準直的伽瑪源或 β 源沿晶體長度逐點照射，記錄光電峰位置得到光收集均勻性曲線；比較不同反射層與耦合材料下的峰位與解析度，並以光線追跡模擬（含表面粗糙度與反射層模型）重現量測，作為量產包覆規格的依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Irradiate the crystal point by point along its length with a collimated gamma or beta source and record the photopeak position to obtain the light-collection uniformity curve; compare peak position and resolution for different reflectors and coupling materials, and reproduce the measurement with ray-tracing simulation that includes surface roughness and reflector models as the basis for production wrapping specifications. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a464-v12-12","title":"光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層：失效診斷","titleEn":"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「反射層、光學膠與出光面」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Reflector, optical grease and exit face” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"光學膠在熱循環後收縮產生氣泡或脫層，出光面形成局部空氣隙，光收集下降且依位置不同，光電峰出現低能肩部；反射層包覆鬆緊不一時，同批模組的增益差異可達 10% 以上。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Optical grease that shrinks after thermal cycling forms bubbles or delaminates, leaving local air gaps at the exit face that lower light collection position-dependently and add a low-energy shoulder to the photopeak; uneven reflector wrapping can spread gains across a batch of modules by more than 10%. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：表面拋光或粗化、反射層與晶體之間是否留空氣隙，都會改變光收集效率與沿長度方向的均勻性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Polished versus roughened surfaces and whether an air gap is left between reflector and crystal both change light-collection efficiency and its uniformity along the length.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"光學膠在熱循環後收縮產生氣泡或脫層，出光面形成局部空氣隙，光收集下降且依位置不同，光電峰出現低能肩部；反射層包覆鬆緊不一時，同批模組的增益差異可達 10% 以上。","textEn":"Optical grease that shrinks after thermal cycling forms bubbles or delaminates, leaving local air gaps at the exit face that lower light collection position-dependently and add a low-energy shoulder to the photopeak; uneven reflector wrapping can spread gains across a batch of modules by more than 10%.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「光收集效率、光學耦合與反射層」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Light-collection efficiency, optical coupling and reflectors\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["光學膠在熱循環後收縮產生氣泡或脫層，出光面形成局部空氣隙，光收集下降且依位置不同，光電峰出現低能肩部。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。"],"optionsEn":["Optical grease that shrinks after thermal cycling forms bubbles or delaminates, leaving local air gaps at the exit face that lower light collection position-dependently and add a low-energy shoulder to the photopeak.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons."],"answer":0,"explanation":"光學膠在熱循環後收縮產生氣泡或脫層，出光面形成局部空氣隙，光收集下降且依位置不同，光電峰出現低能肩部；反射層包覆鬆緊不一時，同批模組的增益差異可達 10% 以上。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Optical grease that shrinks after thermal cycling forms bubbles or delaminates, leaving local air gaps at the exit face that lower light collection position-dependently and add a low-energy shoulder to the photopeak; uneven reflector wrapping can spread gains across a batch of modules by more than 10%. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a464-v12-13","title":"PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「光電倍增管與矽光電倍增器」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Photomultiplier tube and silicon photomultiplier” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"光電倍增管以雙鹼光電陰極把光子轉成光電子，量子效率約 25% 到 43%，再經十級左右打拿極倍增到 10⁶ 至 10⁷ 倍，雜訊低、面積大，但需要高壓且怕磁場。矽光電倍增器由數千到數萬個工作在崩潰電壓以上的微單元並聯而成，每個微單元被觸發後輸出固定電荷，光子偵測效率約 40% 到 50%，體積小、低電壓、不受磁場影響，但有暗計數、串擾與後脈衝，且同一微單元在恢復前無法再計數，強光下會飽和失去線性。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「光電倍增管與矽光電倍增器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A photomultiplier tube converts photons to photoelectrons on a bialkali photocathode with quantum efficiency of about 25% to 43% and multiplies them through about ten dynodes by 10⁶ to 10⁷, offering low noise and large area but needing high voltage and fearing magnetic fields. A silicon photomultiplier consists of thousands to tens of thousands of microcells biased above breakdown in parallel, each delivering a fixed charge when fired, with photon detection efficiency of about 40% to 50%; it is compact, low-voltage and immune to magnetic fields, but shows dark counts, crosstalk and afterpulsing, and a microcell cannot count again until it recovers, so it saturates and loses linearity under bright light. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Photomultiplier tube and silicon photomultiplier”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：SiPM 觸發微單元數 N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The number of fired microcells is N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)].","failure":"常見誤解：「SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「光電倍增管與矽光電倍增器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Photomultiplier tube and silicon photomultiplier”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-13-k1","title":"PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和","titleEn":"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation","text":"光電倍增管以雙鹼光電陰極把光子轉成光電子，量子效率約 25% 到 43%，再經十級左右打拿極倍增到 10⁶ 至 10⁷ 倍，雜訊低、面積大，但需要高壓且怕磁場。矽光電倍增器由數千到數萬個工作在崩潰電壓以上的微單元並聯而成，每個微單元被觸發後輸出固定電荷，光子偵測效率約 40% 到 50%，體積小、低電壓、不受磁場影響，但有暗計數、串擾與後脈衝，且同一微單元在恢復前無法再計數，強光下會飽和失去線性。","textEn":"A photomultiplier tube converts photons to photoelectrons on a bialkali photocathode with quantum efficiency of about 25% to 43% and multiplies them through about ten dynodes by 10⁶ to 10⁷, offering low noise and large area but needing high voltage and fearing magnetic fields. A silicon photomultiplier consists of thousands to tens of thousands of microcells biased above breakdown in parallel, each delivering a fixed charge when fired, with photon detection efficiency of about 40% to 50%; it is compact, low-voltage and immune to magnetic fields, but shows dark counts, crosstalk and afterpulsing, and a microcell cannot count again until it recovers, so it saturates and loses linearity under bright light.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation\" is correct?","options":["SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。","光電倍增管以雙鹼光電陰極把光子轉成光電子，量子效率約 25% 到 43%，再經十級左右打拿極倍增到 10⁶ 至 10⁷ 倍，雜訊低、面積大，但需要高壓且怕磁場。","只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。"],"optionsEn":["A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons.","A photomultiplier tube converts photons to photoelectrons on a bialkali photocathode with quantum efficiency of about 25% to 43% and multiplies them through about ten dynodes by 10⁶ to 10⁷, offering low noise and large area but needing high voltage and fearing magnetic fields.","A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"光電倍增管以雙鹼光電陰極把光子轉成光電子，量子效率約 25% 到 43%，再經十級左右打拿極倍增到 10⁶ 至 10⁷ 倍，雜訊低、面積大，但需要高壓且怕磁場。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A photomultiplier tube converts photons to photoelectrons on a bialkali photocathode with quantum efficiency of about 25% to 43% and multiplies them through about ten dynodes by 10⁶ to 10⁷, offering low noise and large area but needing high voltage and fearing magnetic fields. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a464-v12-14","title":"PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和：定量估算","titleEn":"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「光電倍增管與矽光電倍增器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Photomultiplier tube and silicon photomultiplier” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：SiPM 觸發微單元數 N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]。3×3 mm²、25 µm 微單元約 14 400 個；LYSO 吸收 511 keV 約產生 32 000×0.511 ≈ 16 350 光子，光收集 0.6、PDE 0.4 得 N_pe ≈ 3920，N_fired ≈ 3440，非線性約 12.5%，必須在能量刻度中修正。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The number of fired microcells is N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]. A 3×3 mm² SiPM with 25 µm cells has about 14 400 cells; LYSO absorbing 511 keV gives about 32 000×0.511 ≈ 16 350 photons, and with light collection 0.6 and PDE 0.4, N_pe ≈ 3920, N_fired ≈ 3440, a nonlinearity of about 12.5% that the energy calibration must correct. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：PMT 以單光電子峰量測增益與其對高壓的關係；SiPM 以弱脈衝 LED 取得多光電子峰譜，從峰間距得到增益、從零光電子機率以泊松統計推得平均光電子數與 PDE，在暗室中量測暗計數率與串擾機率，並以多個伽瑪能量點畫出輸出對能量曲線評估飽和。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: For a PMT measure gain and its high-voltage dependence from the single-photoelectron peak; for a SiPM record a multi-photoelectron spectrum with a weakly pulsed LED, derive gain from peak spacing and the mean photoelectron number and PDE from the zero-photoelectron probability by Poisson statistics, measure dark-count rate and crosstalk probability in the dark, and plot output against several gamma energies to assess saturation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"SiPM 觸發微單元數 N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]。3×3 mm²、25 µm 微單元約 14 400 個；LYSO 吸收 511 keV 約產生 32 000×0.511 ≈ 16 350 光子，光收集 0.6、PDE 0.4 得 N_pe ≈ 3920，N_fired ≈ 3440，非線性約 12.5%，必須在能量刻度中修正。","textEn":"The number of fired microcells is N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]. A 3×3 mm² SiPM with 25 µm cells has about 14 400 cells; LYSO absorbing 511 keV gives about 32 000×0.511 ≈ 16 350 photons, and with light collection 0.6 and PDE 0.4, N_pe ≈ 3920, N_fired ≈ 3440, a nonlinearity of about 12.5% that the energy calibration must correct.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation\", which statement holds?","options":["衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。","光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。","SiPM 觸發微單元數 N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]。"],"optionsEn":["A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better.","The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.","The number of fired microcells is N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]."],"answer":2,"explanation":"SiPM 觸發微單元數 N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The number of fired microcells is N_fired = N_cell·[1 − exp(−N_pe/N_cell)]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a464-v12-15","title":"PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和：量測與驗證","titleEn":"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「光電倍增管與矽光電倍增器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Photomultiplier tube and silicon photomultiplier” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"PMT 以單光電子峰量測增益與其對高壓的關係；SiPM 以弱脈衝 LED 取得多光電子峰譜，從峰間距得到增益、從零光電子機率以泊松統計推得平均光電子數與 PDE，在暗室中量測暗計數率與串擾機率，並以多個伽瑪能量點畫出輸出對能量曲線評估飽和。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"For a PMT measure gain and its high-voltage dependence from the single-photoelectron peak; for a SiPM record a multi-photoelectron spectrum with a weakly pulsed LED, derive gain from peak spacing and the mean photoelectron number and PDE from the zero-photoelectron probability by Poisson statistics, measure dark-count rate and crosstalk probability in the dark, and plot output against several gamma energies to assess saturation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：在強磁場附近使用未屏蔽的 PMT，光電子軌跡偏轉使增益下降數十個百分比且隨方位變化；SiPM 若選太大的微單元以追求 PDE，高能事件飽和使光電峰被壓縮，高能端的能量刻度系統性偏低。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An unshielded PMT near a strong magnetic field loses tens of percent of gain, varying with orientation, as photoelectron trajectories bend; a SiPM chosen with oversized microcells to maximise PDE saturates on high-energy events, compressing photopeaks and biasing the high-energy calibration low.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"PMT 以單光電子峰量測增益與其對高壓的關係；SiPM 以弱脈衝 LED 取得多光電子峰譜，從峰間距得到增益、從零光電子機率以泊松統計推得平均光電子數與 PDE，在暗室中量測暗計數率與串擾機率，並以多個伽瑪能量點畫出輸出對能量曲線評估飽和。","textEn":"For a PMT measure gain and its high-voltage dependence from the single-photoelectron peak; for a SiPM record a multi-photoelectron spectrum with a weakly pulsed LED, derive gain from peak spacing and the mean photoelectron number and PDE from the zero-photoelectron probability by Poisson statistics, measure dark-count rate and crosstalk probability in the dark, and plot output against several gamma energies to assess saturation.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation\"?","options":["PMT 以單光電子峰量測增益與其對高壓的關係。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。"],"optionsEn":["For a PMT measure gain and its high-voltage dependence from the single-photoelectron peak.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator."],"answer":0,"explanation":"PMT 以單光電子峰量測增益與其對高壓的關係；SiPM 以弱脈衝 LED 取得多光電子峰譜，從峰間距得到增益、從零光電子機率以泊松統計推得平均光電子數與 PDE，在暗室中量測暗計數率與串擾機率，並以多個伽瑪能量點畫出輸出對能量曲線評估飽和。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"For a PMT measure gain and its high-voltage dependence from the single-photoelectron peak; for a SiPM record a multi-photoelectron spectrum with a weakly pulsed LED, derive gain from peak spacing and the mean photoelectron number and PDE from the zero-photoelectron probability by Poisson statistics, measure dark-count rate and crosstalk probability in the dark, and plot output against several gamma energies to assess saturation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a464-v12-16","title":"PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和：失效診斷","titleEn":"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「光電倍增管與矽光電倍增器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Photomultiplier tube and silicon photomultiplier” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"在強磁場附近使用未屏蔽的 PMT，光電子軌跡偏轉使增益下降數十個百分比且隨方位變化；SiPM 若選太大的微單元以追求 PDE，高能事件飽和使光電峰被壓縮，高能端的能量刻度系統性偏低。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An unshielded PMT near a strong magnetic field loses tens of percent of gain, varying with orientation, as photoelectron trajectories bend; a SiPM chosen with oversized microcells to maximise PDE saturates on high-energy events, compressing photopeaks and biasing the high-energy calibration low. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：矽光電倍增器由數千到數萬個工作在崩潰電壓以上的微單元並聯而成，每個微單元被觸發後輸出固定電荷，光子偵測效率約 40% 到 50%，體積小、低電壓、不受磁場影響，但有暗計數、串擾與後脈衝，且同一微單元在恢復前無法再計數，強光下會飽和失去線性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A silicon photomultiplier consists of thousands to tens of thousands of microcells biased above breakdown in parallel, each delivering a fixed charge when fired, with photon detection efficiency of about 40% to 50%; it is compact, low-voltage and immune to magnetic fields, but shows dark counts, crosstalk and afterpulsing, and a microcell cannot count again until it recovers, so it saturates and loses linearity under bright light.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在強磁場附近使用未屏蔽的 PMT，光電子軌跡偏轉使增益下降數十個百分比且隨方位變化；SiPM 若選太大的微單元以追求 PDE，高能事件飽和使光電峰被壓縮，高能端的能量刻度系統性偏低。","textEn":"An unshielded PMT near a strong magnetic field loses tens of percent of gain, varying with orientation, as photoelectron trajectories bend; a SiPM chosen with oversized microcells to maximise PDE saturates on high-energy events, compressing photopeaks and biasing the high-energy calibration low.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「PMT 與 SiPM：量子效率、增益與飽和」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"PMT and SiPM: quantum efficiency, gain and saturation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","在強磁場附近使用未屏蔽的 PMT，光電子軌跡偏轉使增益下降數十個百分比且隨方位變化。","只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","An unshielded PMT near a strong magnetic field loses tens of percent of gain, varying with orientation, as photoelectron trajectories bend.","A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在強磁場附近使用未屏蔽的 PMT，光電子軌跡偏轉使增益下降數十個百分比且隨方位變化；SiPM 若選太大的微單元以追求 PDE，高能事件飽和使光電峰被壓縮，高能端的能量刻度系統性偏低。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An unshielded PMT near a strong magnetic field loses tens of percent of gain, varying with orientation, as photoelectron trajectories bend; a SiPM chosen with oversized microcells to maximise PDE saturates on high-energy events, compressing photopeaks and biasing the high-energy calibration low. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a464-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「能量刻度與解析度分解」與「增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition\" and \"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a464-v12-17","title":"能量刻度與解析度分解：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「¹³⁷Cs 光電峰與能量刻度」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “¹³⁷Cs photopeak and energy calibration” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"能量解析度以光電峰的半高寬除以峰位表示。光電子數服從泊松統計，再乘上倍增過程的超額雜訊因子，構成統計項；但無機晶體的光產額隨電子能量並不嚴格成比例，這種非比例性讓不同路徑的電子串產生不同光量，形成無法靠增加光電子數消除的本質項；另外還有光收集不均勻與電子雜訊。工程上要把量到的解析度分解成這幾項，才知道改善應該投資在光偵測器、包覆還是晶體本身。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「¹³⁷Cs 光電峰與能量刻度」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Energy resolution is the photopeak FWHM divided by its position. The photoelectron number follows Poisson statistics, multiplied by the excess noise factor of the multiplication, which forms the statistical term; but inorganic crystals do not yield light strictly in proportion to electron energy, and this non-proportionality makes different electron cascades produce different amounts of light, an intrinsic term that more photoelectrons cannot remove; light-collection non-uniformity and electronic noise add further terms. Engineers must decompose the measured resolution into these terms to know whether to invest in the photodetector, the wrapping or the crystal itself. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “¹³⁷Cs photopeak and energy calibration”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：統計項 R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The statistical term is R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe).","failure":"常見誤解：「只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「¹³⁷Cs 光電峰與能量刻度」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “¹³⁷Cs photopeak and energy calibration”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-17-k1","title":"能量刻度與解析度分解","titleEn":"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition","text":"能量解析度以光電峰的半高寬除以峰位表示。光電子數服從泊松統計，再乘上倍增過程的超額雜訊因子，構成統計項；但無機晶體的光產額隨電子能量並不嚴格成比例，這種非比例性讓不同路徑的電子串產生不同光量，形成無法靠增加光電子數消除的本質項；另外還有光收集不均勻與電子雜訊。","textEn":"Energy resolution is the photopeak FWHM divided by its position. The photoelectron number follows Poisson statistics, multiplied by the excess noise factor of the multiplication, which forms the statistical term; but inorganic crystals do not yield light strictly in proportion to electron energy, and this non-proportionality makes different electron cascades produce different amounts of light, an intrinsic term that more photoelectrons cannot remove; light-collection non-uniformity and electronic noise add further terms.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「能量刻度與解析度分解」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition\" is correct?","options":["只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。","能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。","能量解析度以光電峰的半高寬除以峰位表示。"],"optionsEn":["A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit.","Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.","Energy resolution is the photopeak FWHM divided by its position."],"answer":2,"explanation":"能量解析度以光電峰的半高寬除以峰位表示。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Energy resolution is the photopeak FWHM divided by its position. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a464-v12-18","title":"能量刻度與解析度分解：定量估算","titleEn":"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「¹³⁷Cs 光電峰與能量刻度」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “¹³⁷Cs photopeak and energy calibration” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：統計項 R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe)。NaI(Tl) 在 662 keV 產生 25 160 光子，光收集 0.6、量子效率 0.30 得 N_pe ≈ 4530，ENF = 1.2 時 R_stat ≈ 3.8%；若實測 7.0%，本質與不均勻項 ≈ √(7.0² − 3.8²) ≈ 5.9%，主導解析度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The statistical term is R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe). NaI(Tl) produces 25 160 photons at 662 keV; with light collection 0.6 and quantum efficiency 0.30, N_pe ≈ 4530 and with ENF = 1.2, R_stat ≈ 3.8%; if 7.0% is measured, the intrinsic plus non-uniformity term is ≈ √(7.0² − 3.8²) ≈ 5.9% and dominates the resolution. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV、¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 與 ⁶⁰Co 1173、1333 keV 等多點建立能量刻度，擬合線性與二次項並檢查殘差；以單光電子刻度換算各能量點的 N_pe，畫出解析度平方對 1/E 的關係，截距與斜率分別對應本質項與統計項，並與前次量測比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build the energy scale from several lines such as ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV, ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV and ⁶⁰Co 1173 and 1333 keV, fit linear and quadratic terms and check residuals; convert each energy point to N_pe with the single-photoelectron calibration, plot resolution squared against 1/E so that intercept and slope separate intrinsic and statistical terms, and compare with the previous measurement.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"統計項 R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe)。NaI(Tl) 在 662 keV 產生 25 160 光子，光收集 0.6、量子效率 0.30 得 N_pe ≈ 4530，ENF = 1.2 時 R_stat ≈ 3.8%；若實測 7.0%，本質與不均勻項 ≈ √(7.0² − 3.8²) ≈ 5.9%，主導解析度。","textEn":"The statistical term is R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe). NaI(Tl) produces 25 160 photons at 662 keV; with light collection 0.6 and quantum efficiency 0.30, N_pe ≈ 4530 and with ENF = 1.2, R_stat ≈ 3.8%; if 7.0% is measured, the intrinsic plus non-uniformity term is ≈ √(7.0² − 3.8²) ≈ 5.9% and dominates the resolution.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「能量刻度與解析度分解」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition\", which statement holds?","options":["統計項 R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe)。","符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。","同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。"],"optionsEn":["The statistical term is R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe).","Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency.","Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator."],"answer":0,"explanation":"統計項 R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The statistical term is R_stat = 2.355·√(ENF/N_pe). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a464-v12-19","title":"能量刻度與解析度分解：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「¹³⁷Cs 光電峰與能量刻度」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “¹³⁷Cs photopeak and energy calibration” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV、¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 與 ⁶⁰Co 1173、1333 keV 等多點建立能量刻度，擬合線性與二次項並檢查殘差；以單光電子刻度換算各能量點的 N_pe，畫出解析度平方對 1/E 的關係，截距與斜率分別對應本質項與統計項，並與前次量測比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build the energy scale from several lines such as ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV, ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV and ⁶⁰Co 1173 and 1333 keV, fit linear and quadratic terms and check residuals; convert each energy point to N_pe with the single-photoelectron calibration, plot resolution squared against 1/E so that intercept and slope separate intrinsic and statistical terms, and compare with the previous measurement. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：只用單一 ¹³⁷Cs 點做線性刻度而忽略晶體非比例性與 SiPM 飽和，低能 X 光與高能伽瑪的能量會偏差數個百分比，核種鑑別可能把峰指認錯誤。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A single-point linear calibration at ¹³⁷Cs that ignores crystal non-proportionality and SiPM saturation misplaces low-energy X-rays and high-energy gammas by several percent, so nuclide identification may assign peaks wrongly.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV、¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 與 ⁶⁰Co 1173、1333 keV 等多點建立能量刻度，擬合線性與二次項並檢查殘差；以單光電子刻度換算各能量點的 N_pe，畫出解析度平方對 1/E 的關係，截距與斜率分別對應本質項與統計項，並與前次量測比較。","textEn":"Build the energy scale from several lines such as ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV, ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV and ⁶⁰Co 1173 and 1333 keV, fit linear and quadratic terms and check residuals; convert each energy point to N_pe with the single-photoelectron calibration, plot resolution squared against 1/E so that intercept and slope separate intrinsic and statistical terms, and compare with the previous measurement.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「能量刻度與解析度分解」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以 ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV、¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 與 ⁶⁰Co 1173、1333 keV 等多點建立能量刻度，擬合線性與二次項並檢查殘差。","晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Build the energy scale from several lines such as ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV, ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV and ⁶⁰Co 1173 and 1333 keV, fit linear and quadratic terms and check residuals.","The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV、¹³⁷Cs 662 keV 與 ⁶⁰Co 1173、1333 keV 等多點建立能量刻度，擬合線性與二次項並檢查殘差；以單光電子刻度換算各能量點的 N_pe，畫出解析度平方對 1/E 的關係，截距與斜率分別對應本質項與統計項，並與前次量測比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build the energy scale from several lines such as ²⁴¹Am 59.5 keV, ¹³⁷Cs 662 keV and ⁶⁰Co 1173 and 1333 keV, fit linear and quadratic terms and check residuals; convert each energy point to N_pe with the single-photoelectron calibration, plot resolution squared against 1/E so that intercept and slope separate intrinsic and statistical terms, and compare with the previous measurement. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a464-v12-20","title":"能量刻度與解析度分解：失效診斷","titleEn":"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「¹³⁷Cs 光電峰與能量刻度」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “¹³⁷Cs photopeak and energy calibration” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"只用單一 ¹³⁷Cs 點做線性刻度而忽略晶體非比例性與 SiPM 飽和，低能 X 光與高能伽瑪的能量會偏差數個百分比，核種鑑別可能把峰指認錯誤。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A single-point linear calibration at ¹³⁷Cs that ignores crystal non-proportionality and SiPM saturation misplaces low-energy X-rays and high-energy gammas by several percent, so nuclide identification may assign peaks wrongly. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：工程上要把量到的解析度分解成這幾項，才知道改善應該投資在光偵測器、包覆還是晶體本身。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Engineers must decompose the measured resolution into these terms to know whether to invest in the photodetector, the wrapping or the crystal itself.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只用單一 ¹³⁷Cs 點做線性刻度而忽略晶體非比例性與 SiPM 飽和，低能 X 光與高能伽瑪的能量會偏差數個百分比，核種鑑別可能把峰指認錯誤。","textEn":"A single-point linear calibration at ¹³⁷Cs that ignores crystal non-proportionality and SiPM saturation misplaces low-energy X-rays and high-energy gammas by several percent, so nuclide identification may assign peaks wrongly.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「能量刻度與解析度分解」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Energy calibration and resolution decomposition\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。","只用單一 ¹³⁷Cs 點做線性刻度而忽略晶體非比例性與 SiPM 飽和，低能 X 光與高能伽瑪的能量會偏差數個百分比，核種鑑別可能把峰指認錯誤。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.","A single-point linear calibration at ¹³⁷Cs that ignores crystal non-proportionality and SiPM saturation misplaces low-energy X-rays and high-energy gammas by several percent, so nuclide identification may assign peaks wrongly."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只用單一 ¹³⁷Cs 點做線性刻度而忽略晶體非比例性與 SiPM 飽和，低能 X 光與高能伽瑪的能量會偏差數個百分比，核種鑑別可能把峰指認錯誤。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A single-point linear calibration at ¹³⁷Cs that ignores crystal non-proportionality and SiPM saturation misplaces low-energy X-rays and high-energy gammas by several percent, so nuclide identification may assign peaks wrongly. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a464-v12-21","title":"增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「偏壓、溫度感測與 LED 監測」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Bias, temperature sensing and LED monitor” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"閃爍偵測器的峰位會隨溫度與偏壓漂移：晶體光產額本身有溫度係數，PMT 增益隨高壓呈冪次關係，SiPM 的崩潰電壓隨溫度上升，固定偏壓下過電壓變小、增益與 PDE 同時下降。長時間運轉的系統因此需要溫度感測與偏壓補償，並以穩定的 LED 光脈衝或內建參考放射源持續監測增益，把光偵測器漂移與晶體變化分開判斷。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「偏壓、溫度感測與 LED 監測」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Peak positions drift with temperature and bias: crystal light yield has its own temperature coefficient, PMT gain follows a power law in high voltage, and the SiPM breakdown voltage rises with temperature so that at fixed bias the overvoltage shrinks and gain and PDE fall together. Long-running systems therefore need temperature sensing with bias compensation and continuous gain monitoring with a stable LED pulser or an embedded reference source, distinguishing photodetector drift from crystal changes. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Bias, temperature sensing and LED monitor”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：SiPM 增益正比於過電壓 V_ov；假設崩潰電壓溫度係數 54 mV/K、V_ov = 3 V，則 ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K，溫度變化 5 K 使峰位移動約 9%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: SiPM gain is proportional to overvoltage V_ov; assuming a breakdown-voltage temperature coefficient of 54 mV/K and V_ov = 3 V, ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K, so a 5 K change shifts peaks by about 9%.","failure":"常見誤解：「能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「偏壓、溫度感測與 LED 監測」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Bias, temperature sensing and LED monitor”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-21-k1","title":"增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測","titleEn":"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring","text":"閃爍偵測器的峰位會隨溫度與偏壓漂移：晶體光產額本身有溫度係數，PMT 增益隨高壓呈冪次關係，SiPM 的崩潰電壓隨溫度上升，固定偏壓下過電壓變小、增益與 PDE 同時下降。長時間運轉的系統因此需要溫度感測與偏壓補償，並以穩定的 LED 光脈衝或內建參考放射源持續監測增益，把光偵測器漂移與晶體變化分開判斷。","textEn":"Peak positions drift with temperature and bias: crystal light yield has its own temperature coefficient, PMT gain follows a power law in high voltage, and the SiPM breakdown voltage rises with temperature so that at fixed bias the overvoltage shrinks and gain and PDE fall together. Long-running systems therefore need temperature sensing with bias compensation and continuous gain monitoring with a stable LED pulser or an embedded reference source, distinguishing photodetector drift from crystal changes.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring\" is correct?","options":["閃爍偵測器的峰位會隨溫度與偏壓漂移：晶體光產額本身有溫度係數，PMT 增益隨高壓呈冪次關係，SiPM 的崩潰電壓隨溫度上升，固定偏壓下過電壓變小、增益與 PDE 同時下降。","能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。","衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。"],"optionsEn":["Peak positions drift with temperature and bias: crystal light yield has its own temperature coefficient, PMT gain follows a power law in high voltage, and the SiPM breakdown voltage rises with temperature so that at fixed bias the overvoltage shrinks and gain and PDE fall together.","Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.","A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better."],"answer":0,"explanation":"閃爍偵測器的峰位會隨溫度與偏壓漂移：晶體光產額本身有溫度係數，PMT 增益隨高壓呈冪次關係，SiPM 的崩潰電壓隨溫度上升，固定偏壓下過電壓變小、增益與 PDE 同時下降。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Peak positions drift with temperature and bias: crystal light yield has its own temperature coefficient, PMT gain follows a power law in high voltage, and the SiPM breakdown voltage rises with temperature so that at fixed bias the overvoltage shrinks and gain and PDE fall together. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a464-v12-22","title":"增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測：定量估算","titleEn":"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「偏壓、溫度感測與 LED 監測」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Bias, temperature sensing and LED monitor” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：SiPM 增益正比於過電壓 V_ov；假設崩潰電壓溫度係數 54 mV/K、V_ov = 3 V，則 ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K，溫度變化 5 K 使峰位移動約 9%。PMT 增益 G ∝ V^(k·n)，取 k = 0.7、n = 10 級，高壓漣波 0.1% 造成增益變化約 0.7%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: SiPM gain is proportional to overvoltage V_ov; assuming a breakdown-voltage temperature coefficient of 54 mV/K and V_ov = 3 V, ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K, so a 5 K change shifts peaks by about 9%. PMT gain follows G ∝ V^(k·n); with k = 0.7 and n = 10 stages, a 0.1% high-voltage ripple changes gain by about 0.7%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把模組放入溫控箱，在 15 到 35 °C 間分階段量測 LED 峰與 ¹³⁷Cs 光電峰位置，求出各自的溫度係數；開啟偏壓補償後重複量測，確認峰位變化壓到 0.5%/K 以下；並以長時間記錄比較 LED 與放射源峰的比值，判斷漂移來自光偵測器還是晶體。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place the module in a climate chamber and measure LED and ¹³⁷Cs photopeak positions in steps between 15 and 35 °C to obtain their temperature coefficients; repeat with bias compensation enabled and confirm peak movement below 0.5%/K; compare the ratio of LED and source peaks over long recordings to tell photodetector drift from crystal drift.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"SiPM 增益正比於過電壓 V_ov；假設崩潰電壓溫度係數 54 mV/K、V_ov = 3 V，則 ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K，溫度變化 5 K 使峰位移動約 9%。PMT 增益 G ∝ V^(k·n)，取 k = 0.7、n = 10 級，高壓漣波 0.1% 造成增益變化約 0.7%。","textEn":"SiPM gain is proportional to overvoltage V_ov; assuming a breakdown-voltage temperature coefficient of 54 mV/K and V_ov = 3 V, ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K, so a 5 K change shifts peaks by about 9%. PMT gain follows G ∝ V^(k·n); with k = 0.7 and n = 10 stages, a 0.1% high-voltage ripple changes gain by about 0.7%.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring\", which statement holds?","options":["光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。","SiPM 增益正比於過電壓 V_ov。","晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。"],"optionsEn":["The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.","SiPM gain is proportional to overvoltage V_ov.","The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light."],"answer":1,"explanation":"SiPM 增益正比於過電壓 V_ov；假設崩潰電壓溫度係數 54 mV/K、V_ov = 3 V，則 ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K，溫度變化 5 K 使峰位移動約 9%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"SiPM gain is proportional to overvoltage V_ov; assuming a breakdown-voltage temperature coefficient of 54 mV/K and V_ov = 3 V, ΔG/G ≈ 0.054/3 ≈ 1.8%/K, so a 5 K change shifts peaks by about 9%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a464-v12-23","title":"增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「偏壓、溫度感測與 LED 監測」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Bias, temperature sensing and LED monitor” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把模組放入溫控箱，在 15 到 35 °C 間分階段量測 LED 峰與 ¹³⁷Cs 光電峰位置，求出各自的溫度係數；開啟偏壓補償後重複量測，確認峰位變化壓到 0.5%/K 以下；並以長時間記錄比較 LED 與放射源峰的比值，判斷漂移來自光偵測器還是晶體。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place the module in a climate chamber and measure LED and ¹³⁷Cs photopeak positions in steps between 15 and 35 °C to obtain their temperature coefficients; repeat with bias compensation enabled and confirm peak movement below 0.5%/K; compare the ratio of LED and source peaks over long recordings to tell photodetector drift from crystal drift. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：白天與夜間的機房溫差讓未補償的 SiPM 系統峰位漂移近 10%，能量窗口固定時計數率出現日週期變化，被誤認為放射源或樣品的真實變化；若 LED 本身也隨溫度漂移，監測反而把錯誤寫入修正。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Day-night room temperature swings shift peaks by nearly 10% in an uncompensated SiPM system, so with a fixed energy window the count rate shows a daily cycle that is mistaken for a real change in source or sample; if the LED itself drifts with temperature, monitoring writes the error into the correction.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把模組放入溫控箱，在 15 到 35 °C 間分階段量測 LED 峰與 ¹³⁷Cs 光電峰位置，求出各自的溫度係數；開啟偏壓補償後重複量測，確認峰位變化壓到 0.5%/K 以下；並以長時間記錄比較 LED 與放射源峰的比值，判斷漂移來自光偵測器還是晶體。","textEn":"Place the module in a climate chamber and measure LED and ¹³⁷Cs photopeak positions in steps between 15 and 35 °C to obtain their temperature coefficients; repeat with bias compensation enabled and confirm peak movement below 0.5%/K; compare the ratio of LED and source peaks over long recordings to tell photodetector drift from crystal drift.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。","把模組放入溫控箱，在 15 到 35 °C 間分階段量測 LED 峰與 ¹³⁷Cs 光電峰位置，求出各自的溫度係數。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons.","Place the module in a climate chamber and measure LED and ¹³⁷Cs photopeak positions in steps between 15 and 35 °C to obtain their temperature coefficients."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把模組放入溫控箱，在 15 到 35 °C 間分階段量測 LED 峰與 ¹³⁷Cs 光電峰位置，求出各自的溫度係數；開啟偏壓補償後重複量測，確認峰位變化壓到 0.5%/K 以下；並以長時間記錄比較 LED 與放射源峰的比值，判斷漂移來自光偵測器還是晶體。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place the module in a climate chamber and measure LED and ¹³⁷Cs photopeak positions in steps between 15 and 35 °C to obtain their temperature coefficients; repeat with bias compensation enabled and confirm peak movement below 0.5%/K; compare the ratio of LED and source peaks over long recordings to tell photodetector drift from crystal drift. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a464-v12-24","title":"增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「偏壓、溫度感測與 LED 監測」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Bias, temperature sensing and LED monitor” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"白天與夜間的機房溫差讓未補償的 SiPM 系統峰位漂移近 10%，能量窗口固定時計數率出現日週期變化，被誤認為放射源或樣品的真實變化；若 LED 本身也隨溫度漂移，監測反而把錯誤寫入修正。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Day-night room temperature swings shift peaks by nearly 10% in an uncompensated SiPM system, so with a fixed energy window the count rate shows a daily cycle that is mistaken for a real change in source or sample; if the LED itself drifts with temperature, monitoring writes the error into the correction. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：長時間運轉的系統因此需要溫度感測與偏壓補償，並以穩定的 LED 光脈衝或內建參考放射源持續監測增益，把光偵測器漂移與晶體變化分開判斷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Long-running systems therefore need temperature sensing with bias compensation and continuous gain monitoring with a stable LED pulser or an embedded reference source, distinguishing photodetector drift from crystal changes.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"白天與夜間的機房溫差讓未補償的 SiPM 系統峰位漂移近 10%，能量窗口固定時計數率出現日週期變化，被誤認為放射源或樣品的真實變化；若 LED 本身也隨溫度漂移，監測反而把錯誤寫入修正。","textEn":"Day-night room temperature swings shift peaks by nearly 10% in an uncompensated SiPM system, so with a fixed energy window the count rate shows a daily cycle that is mistaken for a real change in source or sample; if the LED itself drifts with temperature, monitoring writes the error into the correction.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「增益穩定度、溫度漂移與監測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gain stability, temperature drift and monitoring\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["白天與夜間的機房溫差讓未補償的 SiPM 系統峰位漂移近 10%，能量窗口固定時計數率出現日週期變化，被誤認為放射源或樣品的真實變化。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。"],"optionsEn":["Day-night room temperature swings shift peaks by nearly 10% in an uncompensated SiPM system, so with a fixed energy window the count rate shows a daily cycle that is mistaken for a real change in source or sample.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better."],"answer":0,"explanation":"白天與夜間的機房溫差讓未補償的 SiPM 系統峰位漂移近 10%，能量窗口固定時計數率出現日週期變化，被誤認為放射源或樣品的真實變化；若 LED 本身也隨溫度漂移，監測反而把錯誤寫入修正。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Day-night room temperature swings shift peaks by nearly 10% in an uncompensated SiPM system, so with a fixed energy window the count rate shows a daily cycle that is mistaken for a real change in source or sample; if the LED itself drifts with temperature, monitoring writes the error into the correction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a464-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「計時解析度與符合量測」與「模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement\" and \"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a464-v12-25","title":"計時解析度與符合量測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「符合時間窗與時間拾取」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Coincidence window and time pick-off” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"閃爍事件的到達時間由最早幾個光電子決定，因此計時解析度取決於光產額、上升與衰減時間、光偵測器的單光子時間抖動以及晶體內光程差。兩個偵測器同時觸發才記錄的符合量測能抑制背景，但窗口內兩個無關事件也會被誤認為符合，形成隨機符合，其速率與兩路單計數率的乘積成正比。正子斷層掃描以 511 keV 光子對的符合定位反應線，飛行時間差進一步把事件定位在線上的某一段，所以符合時間解析度直接換算成影像訊雜比。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「符合時間窗與時間拾取」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The arrival time of a scintillation event is set by the first few photoelectrons, so timing resolution depends on light yield, rise and decay times, the photodetector's single-photon time jitter and optical path differences in the crystal. Coincidence counting, which records only when two detectors fire together, suppresses background, but two unrelated events within the window are also accepted as random coincidences at a rate proportional to the product of the two singles rates. Positron emission tomography locates lines of response from coincident 511 keV photon pairs, and the time-of-flight difference further confines the event to a segment of the line, so coincidence time resolution translates directly into image signal-to-noise. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Coincidence window and time pick-off”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：光統計下限 σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe)：LYSO τd = 40 ns、假設 τr = 0.1 ns、N_pe = 3920，σt ≈ 32 ps，符合時間解析度下限約 √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The photostatistical bound is σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe): for LYSO with τd = 40 ns, an assumed τr = 0.1 ns and N_pe = 3920, σt ≈ 32 ps and the coincidence-time-resolution bound is about √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM.","failure":"常見誤解：「衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「符合時間窗與時間拾取」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Coincidence window and time pick-off”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-25-k1","title":"計時解析度與符合量測","titleEn":"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement","text":"閃爍事件的到達時間由最早幾個光電子決定，因此計時解析度取決於光產額、上升與衰減時間、光偵測器的單光子時間抖動以及晶體內光程差。兩個偵測器同時觸發才記錄的符合量測能抑制背景，但窗口內兩個無關事件也會被誤認為符合，形成隨機符合，其速率與兩路單計數率的乘積成正比。","textEn":"The arrival time of a scintillation event is set by the first few photoelectrons, so timing resolution depends on light yield, rise and decay times, the photodetector's single-photon time jitter and optical path differences in the crystal. Coincidence counting, which records only when two detectors fire together, suppresses background, but two unrelated events within the window are also accepted as random coincidences at a rate proportional to the product of the two singles rates.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「計時解析度與符合量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement\" is correct?","options":["衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。","閃爍事件的到達時間由最早幾個光電子決定，因此計時解析度取決於光產額、上升與衰減時間、光偵測器的單光子時間抖動以及晶體內光程差。","符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。"],"optionsEn":["A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better.","The arrival time of a scintillation event is set by the first few photoelectrons, so timing resolution depends on light yield, rise and decay times, the photodetector's single-photon time jitter and optical path differences in the crystal.","Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"閃爍事件的到達時間由最早幾個光電子決定，因此計時解析度取決於光產額、上升與衰減時間、光偵測器的單光子時間抖動以及晶體內光程差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The arrival time of a scintillation event is set by the first few photoelectrons, so timing resolution depends on light yield, rise and decay times, the photodetector's single-photon time jitter and optical path differences in the crystal. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a464-v12-26","title":"計時解析度與符合量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「符合時間窗與時間拾取」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Coincidence window and time pick-off” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：光統計下限 σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe)：LYSO τd = 40 ns、假設 τr = 0.1 ns、N_pe = 3920，σt ≈ 32 ps，符合時間解析度下限約 √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM。實際 200 ps 對應定位 Δx = c·Δt/2 = 3 cm。隨機符合率 R = 2τ·r1·r2：2τ = 4 ns、單計數各 10⁵ cps 得 40 cps。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The photostatistical bound is σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe): for LYSO with τd = 40 ns, an assumed τr = 0.1 ns and N_pe = 3920, σt ≈ 32 ps and the coincidence-time-resolution bound is about √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM. A real 200 ps corresponds to Δx = c·Δt/2 = 3 cm. The random rate is R = 2τ·r1·r2; with 2τ = 4 ns and 10⁵ cps singles on each side, R = 40 cps. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 ²²Na 正子源置於兩個相同模組之間，記錄時間差分布並擬合半高寬得到符合時間解析度，再除以 √2 得單一偵測器值；改變時間拾取門檻（前緣或恆比鑑別）找最佳點；以延遲窗口法量測隨機符合率，與 2τ·r1·r2 預測比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place a ²²Na positron source between two identical modules, record the time-difference distribution and fit its FWHM as the coincidence time resolution, dividing by √2 for a single detector; vary the time pick-off threshold for leading-edge or constant-fraction discrimination to find the optimum; measure randoms with a delayed window and compare with the 2τ·r1·r2 prediction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"光統計下限 σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe)：LYSO τd = 40 ns、假設 τr = 0.1 ns、N_pe = 3920，σt ≈ 32 ps，符合時間解析度下限約 √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM。實際 200 ps 對應定位 Δx = c·Δt/2 = 3 cm。隨機符合率 R = 2τ·r1·r2：2τ = 4 ns、單計數各 10⁵ cps 得 40 cps。","textEn":"The photostatistical bound is σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe): for LYSO with τd = 40 ns, an assumed τr = 0.1 ns and N_pe = 3920, σt ≈ 32 ps and the coincidence-time-resolution bound is about √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM. A real 200 ps corresponds to Δx = c·Δt/2 = 3 cm. The random rate is R = 2τ·r1·r2; with 2τ = 4 ns and 10⁵ cps singles on each side, R = 40 cps.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「計時解析度與符合量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement\", which statement holds?","options":["同樣沉積 1 MeV，任何粒子在閃爍體中產生的光都一樣多。","SiPM 的輸出電荷永遠與入射光子數成正比。","光統計下限 σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe)：LYSO τd = 40 ns、假設 τr = 0.1 ns、N_pe = 3920，σt ≈ 32 ps，符合時間解析度下限約 √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM。"],"optionsEn":["Any particle depositing 1 MeV produces the same amount of light in a scintillator.","A SiPM's output charge is always proportional to the number of incident photons.","The photostatistical bound is σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe): for LYSO with τd = 40 ns, an assumed τr = 0.1 ns and N_pe = 3920, σt ≈ 32 ps and the coincidence-time-resolution bound is about √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM."],"answer":2,"explanation":"光統計下限 σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe)：LYSO τd = 40 ns、假設 τr = 0.1 ns、N_pe = 3920，σt ≈ 32 ps，符合時間解析度下限約 √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The photostatistical bound is σt ≈ √(τr·τd/N_pe): for LYSO with τd = 40 ns, an assumed τr = 0.1 ns and N_pe = 3920, σt ≈ 32 ps and the coincidence-time-resolution bound is about √2×2.355×32 ≈ 106 ps FWHM. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a464-v12-27","title":"計時解析度與符合量測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「符合時間窗與時間拾取」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Coincidence window and time pick-off” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 ²²Na 正子源置於兩個相同模組之間，記錄時間差分布並擬合半高寬得到符合時間解析度，再除以 √2 得單一偵測器值；改變時間拾取門檻（前緣或恆比鑑別）找最佳點；以延遲窗口法量測隨機符合率，與 2τ·r1·r2 預測比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place a ²²Na positron source between two identical modules, record the time-difference distribution and fit its FWHM as the coincidence time resolution, dividing by √2 for a single detector; vary the time pick-off threshold for leading-edge or constant-fraction discrimination to find the optimum; measure randoms with a delayed window and compare with the 2τ·r1·r2 prediction. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：前緣鑑別在脈衝幅度變化大時產生時間游走，造成與能量相關的時間偏移，符合峰變寬且不對稱；符合窗口開得過寬時，高計數率下隨機符合超過真符合，影像對比與定量全部失真。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Leading-edge discrimination with widely varying pulse amplitudes produces time walk, an energy-dependent timing shift that broadens and skews the coincidence peak; an overly wide coincidence window lets randoms exceed true coincidences at high rates, distorting image contrast and quantification.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 ²²Na 正子源置於兩個相同模組之間，記錄時間差分布並擬合半高寬得到符合時間解析度，再除以 √2 得單一偵測器值；改變時間拾取門檻（前緣或恆比鑑別）找最佳點；以延遲窗口法量測隨機符合率，與 2τ·r1·r2 預測比較。","textEn":"Place a ²²Na positron source between two identical modules, record the time-difference distribution and fit its FWHM as the coincidence time resolution, dividing by √2 for a single detector; vary the time pick-off threshold for leading-edge or constant-fraction discrimination to find the optimum; measure randoms with a delayed window and compare with the 2τ·r1·r2 prediction.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「計時解析度與符合量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement\"?","options":["以 ²²Na 正子源置於兩個相同模組之間，記錄時間差分布並擬合半高寬得到符合時間解析度，再除以 √2 得單一偵測器值。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。"],"optionsEn":["Place a ²²Na positron source between two identical modules, record the time-difference distribution and fit its FWHM as the coincidence time resolution, dividing by √2 for a single detector.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以 ²²Na 正子源置於兩個相同模組之間，記錄時間差分布並擬合半高寬得到符合時間解析度，再除以 √2 得單一偵測器值；改變時間拾取門檻（前緣或恆比鑑別）找最佳點；以延遲窗口法量測隨機符合率，與 2τ·r1·r2 預測比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place a ²²Na positron source between two identical modules, record the time-difference distribution and fit its FWHM as the coincidence time resolution, dividing by √2 for a single detector; vary the time pick-off threshold for leading-edge or constant-fraction discrimination to find the optimum; measure randoms with a delayed window and compare with the 2τ·r1·r2 prediction. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a464-v12-28","title":"計時解析度與符合量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「符合時間窗與時間拾取」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Coincidence window and time pick-off” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"前緣鑑別在脈衝幅度變化大時產生時間游走，造成與能量相關的時間偏移，符合峰變寬且不對稱；符合窗口開得過寬時，高計數率下隨機符合超過真符合，影像對比與定量全部失真。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Leading-edge discrimination with widely varying pulse amplitudes produces time walk, an energy-dependent timing shift that broadens and skews the coincidence peak; an overly wide coincidence window lets randoms exceed true coincidences at high rates, distorting image contrast and quantification. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：正子斷層掃描以 511 keV 光子對的符合定位反應線，飛行時間差進一步把事件定位在線上的某一段，所以符合時間解析度直接換算成影像訊雜比。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Positron emission tomography locates lines of response from coincident 511 keV photon pairs, and the time-of-flight difference further confines the event to a segment of the line, so coincidence time resolution translates directly into image signal-to-noise.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「衰減時間越長的閃爍體收集越多光，計時就越準。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A scintillator with a longer decay collects more light and therefore times better.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"前緣鑑別在脈衝幅度變化大時產生時間游走，造成與能量相關的時間偏移，符合峰變寬且不對稱；符合窗口開得過寬時，高計數率下隨機符合超過真符合，影像對比與定量全部失真。","textEn":"Leading-edge discrimination with widely varying pulse amplitudes produces time walk, an energy-dependent timing shift that broadens and skews the coincidence peak; an overly wide coincidence window lets randoms exceed true coincidences at high rates, distorting image contrast and quantification.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「計時解析度與符合量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Timing resolution and coincidence measurement\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","前緣鑑別在脈衝幅度變化大時產生時間游走，造成與能量相關的時間偏移，符合峰變寬且不對稱；符合窗口開得過寬時，高計數率下隨機符合超過真符合，影像對比與定量全部失真。","符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Leading-edge discrimination with widely varying pulse amplitudes produces time walk, an energy-dependent timing shift that broadens and skews the coincidence peak.","Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"前緣鑑別在脈衝幅度變化大時產生時間游走，造成與能量相關的時間偏移，符合峰變寬且不對稱；符合窗口開得過寬時，高計數率下隨機符合超過真符合，影像對比與定量全部失真。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Leading-edge discrimination with widely varying pulse amplitudes produces time walk, an energy-dependent timing shift that broadens and skews the coincidence peak; an overly wide coincidence window lets randoms exceed true coincidences at high rates, distorting image contrast and quantification. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a464-v12-29","title":"模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「偵測器模組與驗收紀錄」如何決定閃爍體粒子偵測器的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Detector module and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “Scintillation particle detectors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"把晶體、反射層、光偵測器、前端電子與冷卻組成模組時，晶體厚度與材料必須先滿足攔截效率，再兼顧光收集、計時與成本；符合量測的效率是單一偵測器效率的平方，所以厚度不足的代價會被放大。量產時每個模組的增益、解析度與時間偏移都不同，需要逐模組校正表，並以均勻性、死時間、計數率線性與長期穩定度作為驗收項目，連同包覆規格與材料批號寫入交接文件。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「偵測器模組與驗收紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When crystals, reflectors, photodetectors, front-end electronics and cooling are assembled into a module, crystal material and thickness must first meet stopping efficiency before light collection, timing and cost are balanced; coincidence efficiency is the square of single-detector efficiency, so insufficient thickness is penalised twice. In production every module differs in gain, resolution and time offset and needs its own calibration table, and acceptance covers uniformity, dead time, count-rate linearity and long-term stability, filed with wrapping specifications and material batch numbers in the handoff record. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Detector module and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：攔截機率 P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Stopping probability is P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt).","failure":"常見誤解：「符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「偵測器模組與驗收紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Detector module and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-29-k1","title":"模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接","titleEn":"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff","text":"把晶體、反射層、光偵測器、前端電子與冷卻組成模組時，晶體厚度與材料必須先滿足攔截效率，再兼顧光收集、計時與成本；符合量測的效率是單一偵測器效率的平方，所以厚度不足的代價會被放大。量產時每個模組的增益、解析度與時間偏移都不同，需要逐模組校正表，並以均勻性、死時間、計數率線性與長期穩定度作為驗收項目，連同包覆規格與材料批號寫入交接文件。","textEn":"When crystals, reflectors, photodetectors, front-end electronics and cooling are assembled into a module, crystal material and thickness must first meet stopping efficiency before light collection, timing and cost are balanced; coincidence efficiency is the square of single-detector efficiency, so insufficient thickness is penalised twice. In production every module differs in gain, resolution and time offset and needs its own calibration table, and acceptance covers uniformity, dead time, count-rate linearity and long-term stability, filed with wrapping specifications and material batch numbers in the handoff record.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff\" is correct?","options":["符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。","光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。","把晶體、反射層、光偵測器、前端電子與冷卻組成模組時，晶體厚度與材料必須先滿足攔截效率，再兼顧光收集、計時與成本。"],"optionsEn":["Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency.","The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.","When crystals, reflectors, photodetectors, front-end electronics and cooling are assembled into a module, crystal material and thickness must first meet stopping efficiency before light collection, timing and cost are balanced."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把晶體、反射層、光偵測器、前端電子與冷卻組成模組時，晶體厚度與材料必須先滿足攔截效率，再兼顧光收集、計時與成本；符合量測的效率是單一偵測器效率的平方，所以厚度不足的代價會被放大。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When crystals, reflectors, photodetectors, front-end electronics and cooling are assembled into a module, crystal material and thickness must first meet stopping efficiency before light collection, timing and cost are balanced; coincidence efficiency is the square of single-detector efficiency, so insufficient thickness is penalised twice. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a464-v12-30","title":"模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「偵測器模組與驗收紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Detector module and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：攔截機率 P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt)。以 511 keV 衰減長度約 LYSO 11.4 mm、BGO 10.4 mm、NaI(Tl) 29 mm（教學近似）計，20 mm 晶體單側 P 分別約 0.83、0.85、0.50，成對符合效率 P² 約 0.68、0.73、0.25。NaI 要達到相同符合效率需要厚得多的晶體。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Stopping probability is P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt). Taking 511 keV attenuation lengths of about 11.4 mm for LYSO, 10.4 mm for BGO and 29 mm for NaI(Tl) as teaching approximations, a 20 mm crystal stops about 0.83, 0.85 and 0.50 on one side, and pair coincidence efficiency P² is about 0.68, 0.73 and 0.25. NaI needs a much thicker crystal for the same coincidence efficiency. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以已知活度的點源在多個位置量測每個模組的計數率，扣除幾何因子後與蒙地卡羅模擬的攔截效率比較；逐步提高源活度量測計數率線性與死時間；連續運轉一週記錄峰位、解析度與時間偏移的漂移，並把逐模組校正表與量測條件一起交接。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure each module's count rate with a point source of known activity at several positions, correct for geometry and compare with Monte Carlo stopping efficiency; raise source activity step by step to measure count-rate linearity and dead time; run continuously for a week logging drift of peak position, resolution and time offset, and hand over per-module calibration tables together with the measurement conditions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"攔截機率 P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt)。以 511 keV 衰減長度約 LYSO 11.4 mm、BGO 10.4 mm、NaI(Tl) 29 mm（教學近似）計，20 mm 晶體單側 P 分別約 0.83、0.85、0.50，成對符合效率 P² 約 0.68、0.73、0.25。NaI 要達到相同符合效率需要厚得多的晶體。","textEn":"Stopping probability is P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt). Taking 511 keV attenuation lengths of about 11.4 mm for LYSO, 10.4 mm for BGO and 29 mm for NaI(Tl) as teaching approximations, a 20 mm crystal stops about 0.83, 0.85 and 0.50 on one side, and pair coincidence efficiency P² is about 0.68, 0.73 and 0.25. NaI needs a much thicker crystal for the same coincidence efficiency.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["攔截機率 P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt)。","晶體越透明，光就一定越容易被光偵測器收集到。","只要換成量子效率更高的光偵測器，NaI(Tl) 的解析度就能無限改善。"],"optionsEn":["Stopping probability is P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt).","The more transparent the crystal, the more easily the photodetector collects its light.","A higher-efficiency photodetector can improve NaI(Tl) resolution without limit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"攔截機率 P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Stopping probability is P = 1 − exp(−x/λatt). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a464-v12-31","title":"模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「偵測器模組與驗收紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Detector module and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以已知活度的點源在多個位置量測每個模組的計數率，扣除幾何因子後與蒙地卡羅模擬的攔截效率比較；逐步提高源活度量測計數率線性與死時間；連續運轉一週記錄峰位、解析度與時間偏移的漂移，並把逐模組校正表與量測條件一起交接。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure each module's count rate with a point source of known activity at several positions, correct for geometry and compare with Monte Carlo stopping efficiency; raise source activity step by step to measure count-rate linearity and dead time; run continuously for a week logging drift of peak position, resolution and time offset, and hand over per-module calibration tables together with the measurement conditions. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了降低成本選用較薄晶體，單側效率只下降一成多，但符合效率下降二成以上，系統靈敏度不足才在臨床或實驗驗收時被發現；缺少逐模組校正表時，更換單一模組就會在影像中留下環狀假影。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Choosing thinner crystals to save cost lowers single-side efficiency by only a little over a tenth but cuts coincidence efficiency by over a fifth, and the sensitivity shortfall appears only at clinical or experimental acceptance; without per-module calibration tables, replacing a single module leaves ring artefacts in the image.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已知活度的點源在多個位置量測每個模組的計數率，扣除幾何因子後與蒙地卡羅模擬的攔截效率比較；逐步提高源活度量測計數率線性與死時間；連續運轉一週記錄峰位、解析度與時間偏移的漂移，並把逐模組校正表與量測條件一起交接。","textEn":"Measure each module's count rate with a point source of known activity at several positions, correct for geometry and compare with Monte Carlo stopping efficiency; raise source activity step by step to measure count-rate linearity and dead time; run continuously for a week logging drift of peak position, resolution and time offset, and hand over per-module calibration tables together with the measurement conditions.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以已知活度的點源在多個位置量測每個模組的計數率，扣除幾何因子後與蒙地卡羅模擬的攔截效率比較。","能量刻度做過一次之後，閃爍偵測器的峰位就會一直固定。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure each module's count rate with a point source of known activity at several positions, correct for geometry and compare with Monte Carlo stopping efficiency.","Once calibrated, a scintillation detector's peak positions stay fixed."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以已知活度的點源在多個位置量測每個模組的計數率，扣除幾何因子後與蒙地卡羅模擬的攔截效率比較；逐步提高源活度量測計數率線性與死時間；連續運轉一週記錄峰位、解析度與時間偏移的漂移，並把逐模組校正表與量測條件一起交接。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure each module's count rate with a point source of known activity at several positions, correct for geometry and compare with Monte Carlo stopping efficiency; raise source activity step by step to measure count-rate linearity and dead time; run continuously for a week logging drift of peak position, resolution and time offset, and hand over per-module calibration tables together with the measurement conditions. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a464-v12-32","title":"模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"prerequisiteIds":["a464-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「偵測器模組與驗收紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Detector module and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了降低成本選用較薄晶體，單側效率只下降一成多，但符合效率下降二成以上，系統靈敏度不足才在臨床或實驗驗收時被發現；缺少逐模組校正表時，更換單一模組就會在影像中留下環狀假影。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Choosing thinner crystals to save cost lowers single-side efficiency by only a little over a tenth but cuts coincidence efficiency by over a fifth, and the sensitivity shortfall appears only at clinical or experimental acceptance; without per-module calibration tables, replacing a single module leaves ring artefacts in the image. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：量產時每個模組的增益、解析度與時間偏移都不同，需要逐模組校正表，並以均勻性、死時間、計數率線性與長期穩定度作為驗收項目，連同包覆規格與材料批號寫入交接文件。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In production every module differs in gain, resolution and time offset and needs its own calibration table, and acceptance covers uniformity, dead time, count-rate linearity and long-term stability, filed with wrapping specifications and material batch numbers in the handoff record.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「符合量測的效率等於單一偵測器的效率。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Coincidence efficiency equals single-detector efficiency.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a464-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了降低成本選用較薄晶體，單側效率只下降一成多，但符合效率下降二成以上，系統靈敏度不足才在臨床或實驗驗收時被發現；缺少逐模組校正表時，更換單一模組就會在影像中留下環狀假影。","textEn":"Choosing thinner crystals to save cost lowers single-side efficiency by only a little over a tenth but cuts coincidence efficiency by over a fifth, and the sensitivity shortfall appears only at clinical or experimental acceptance; without per-module calibration tables, replacing a single module leaves ring artefacts in the image.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]},{"id":"a464-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「模組整合、攔截效率與驗收交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Module integration, stopping efficiency and acceptance handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","光產額最高的閃爍體在所有應用中都是最好的選擇。","為了降低成本選用較薄晶體，單側效率只下降一成多，但符合效率下降二成以上，系統靈敏度不足才在臨床或實驗驗收時被發現。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","The scintillator with the highest light yield is the best choice for every application.","Choosing thinner crystals to save cost lowers single-side efficiency by only a little over a tenth but cuts coincidence efficiency by over a fifth, and the sensitivity shortfall appears only at clinical or experimental acceptance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"為了降低成本選用較薄晶體，單側效率只下降一成多，但符合效率下降二成以上，系統靈敏度不足才在臨床或實驗驗收時被發現；缺少逐模組校正表時，更換單一模組就會在影像中留下環狀假影。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Choosing thinner crystals to save cost lowers single-side efficiency by only a little over a tenth but cuts coincidence efficiency by over a fifth, and the sensitivity shortfall appears only at clinical or experimental acceptance; without per-module calibration tables, replacing a single module leaves ring artefacts in the image. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-pdg-2024-particle-detectors","v12o-hamamatsu-pmt-handbook","v8-c-sipm","v12o-eljen-ej200"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
